1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,800
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) Tim gets down on one knee.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,020
He looks into Shirley's eyes.

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:09,460
He asks, Will you marry me?

4
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,760
Shirley cries.

5
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,020
Shirley nods her head.

6
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,260
Tim and Shirley hug.

7
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,480
People around them clap.

8
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:25,040
Tim and Shirley call all their friends and

9
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:25,660
family.

10
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:29,200
Tim's mom does not like Shirley.

11
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,260
Tim does not care.
